    {
      "en": "Yumi and I spend some time hanging out in her room together. Well...trying to, at least.",
      "zh": "我和 Yumi 在她的房间里待了一会儿。好吧……至少是试着待了一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Apparently, even though we've been spending more time together as of late, she still absolutely hates my guts.",
      "zh": "看来，尽管我们最近待在一起的时间变多了，她还是打心眼里恨我。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Does she have the right to do that? Yeah, I guess so. But that doesn't mean it isn't a bit of a let down.",
      "zh": "她有这个权利吗？大概有吧。可这也不代表我不觉得有点失落。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I can't tell what it is, but I keep wanting to spend time with her. Maybe I have a thing for being belittled?",
      "zh": "我说不清原因，可我就是一直想和她待在一起。也许我有被贬低的癖好？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
