    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Eventually, and I mean less than twenty minutes later, she kicks me out of the room and I'm left to find something else to do...",
      "zh": "最终——我是说，不到二十分钟之后——她就把我赶出了房间，我只好另找事做……"
